<!DOCTYPE score-partwise PUBLIC "-//Recordare//DTD MusicXML 4.0 Partwise//EN" "http://www.musicxml.org/dtds/partwise.dtd">
<!-- Hand-written for the engraver's spacing tests. Measure 1: a quarter, two
     eighths and a half over a measure's rest, each column spaced by its own
     duration. Measure 2: three triplet quarters over two quarters and a half,
     so a triplet quarter is cut by the second quarter's onset and its two
     parts share its width. Measure 3: five quintuplet eighths over six
     triplet eighths, onsets on the two staves a fifteenth of a quarter apart,
     which stand closer than a notehead's width since their ink stands on
     different staves. -->
